(21, N'Ancient Cham Sanctuary Exploration', 'ancient-cham-sanctuary-exploration', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/cat_icon_21/100/100', N'Marvel at centuries-old brick masonry and mysterious Hindu-inspired mythological sculptures of the ancient Champa kingdom.', 1),
