(23, N'Sandboarding & Desert Dunes Exploration', 'sandboarding-and-desert-dunes-exploration', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/cat_icon_23/100/100', N'Feel the adrenaline rush as you conquer sweeping coastal white and red sand dunes on specialized off-road ATVs or sandboards.', 1),
