(98, N'Ha Long Bay Scenic Seaplane Aerial Tours', 'ha-long-bay-scenic-seaplane-aerial-tours', 'https://picsum.photos/seed/cat_icon_98/100/100', N'Soar above emerald waters and thousands of limestone islets aboard modern seaplanes for an unmatched bird''s-eye view of the UNESCO wonder.', 0),
